    "text": "selmasun.com\nwebsite\nSelma\nLegal Notices, July 17, 2025\n6 hours ago\nTri-County Construction LLC, 2525 US HWY 80 W, Selma, AL 36701 has completed its work on the Wastewater Treatment Plant and Pump Station Upgrades (Replacement of Franklin Street Pump Station, Rehabilitation of Pump Stations 1 & 4, and Re-Sealing of Digestor Tops at the Valley Creek WWTP) CWSRF Project No. CS010879-02 for the Water Works and Sewer Board of the City of Selma. Any person having a claim should notify HAS Engineers, Inc., 1 Satterﬁeld Street, Selma, AL 36701 in writing or call (334)875-1960.",
